    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "During the first month of Parkston's existence, an average of one building was put up every single day.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parkston%2C_South_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first building in Parkston was the local newspaper office, which moved from Dakota City on May 31, 1886.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
